<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<script src="./support.js"></script>
</head>
<body>
<x-dc>
<helmet>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+JP:wght@400;500;700;900&amp;display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
body { margin: 0; background: #e4ded0; color: #241f19; font-family: "Noto Sans JP", system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }
a { color: #7a5e28; }
a:hover { color: #241f19; }
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
:focus { outline: none; }
:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid #7a5e28; outline-offset: 2px; }
.nitte-embed { min-height: 720px; width: 100%; border: 0; display: block; }
@media (max-width: 800px) { .nitte-embed { min-height: 600px; } }
</style>
</helmet>
<div style="max-width:430px;margin:0 auto;background:#fffdf9;min-height:100vh;display:flex;flex-direction:column;box-shadow:0 0 34px rgba(0,0,0,0.18)">

  <header style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:12px 16px;background:#fffdf9;border-bottom:1px solid #e4ded0">
    <a href="W-LP.dc.html" style="display:block;text-decoration:none"><img src="assets/logo-w-gold.png" alt="W" style="height:24px;width:auto;display:block"></a>
    <div style="font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.6;color:#6a6357;font-weight:500">粗利600万円保証付きの<br>営業支援サービス</div>
  </header>

  <div style="flex:1">
    <section style="background:url(data:image/svg+xml;charset=utf-8,%3Csvg%20xmlns=%27http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%27%20width=%27560%27%20height=%27560%27%20viewBox=%270%200%20560%20560%27%3E%3Cg%20fill=%27none%27%20stroke=%27%233b3228%27%20opacity=%270.06%27%3E%3Ccircle%20cx=%27280%27%20cy=%27280%27%20r=%2762%27%20stroke-width=%271.5%27/%3E%3Ccircle%20cx=%27280%27%20cy=%27280%27%20r=%27118%27%20stroke-width=%271.2%27/%3E%3Ccircle%20cx=%27280%27%20cy=%27280%27%20r=%27178%27%20stroke-width=%271%27/%3E%3Ccircle%20cx=%27280%27%20cy=%27280%27%20r=%27244%27%20stroke-width=%270.9%27/%3E%3C/g%3E%3Cg%20fill=%27none%27%20stroke=%27%23a3853f%27%20opacity=%270.075%27%3E%3Ccircle%20cx=%27280%27%20cy=%27280%27%20r=%2790%27%20stroke-width=%271.1%27/%3E%3Ccircle%20cx=%27280%27%20cy=%27280%27%20r=%27210%27%20stroke-width=%270.9%27/%3E%3C/g%3E%3Ccircle%20cx=%27280%27%20cy=%27280%27%20r=%279%27%20fill=%27%23a3853f%27%20opacity=%270.10%27/%3E%3C/svg%3E) center 116%/620px 620px no-repeat, radial-gradient(ellipse 430px 310px at 88% -8%,rgba(194,162,94,0.13),transparent 70%), #fffdf9;padding:46px 24px 50px;text-align:center">
      <div style="width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:50%;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#c2571f 0%,#a33f12 100%);color:#fffdf9;font-size:25px;font-weight:900;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:0 auto 20px;box-shadow:0 10px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.30)">✓</div>
      <h1 style="font-size:24px;line-height:1.75;margin:0;font-weight:900;color:#241f19;letter-spacing:0.02em">資料をお送りしました</h1>
      <div style="width:56px;height:2px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(194,162,94,0),#a33f12,rgba(194,162,94,0));margin:18px auto"></div>
      <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:2.1;color:#4a443b;margin:0">ご登録のメールアドレス宛に資料をお送りしました。<br>1営業日以内に担当よりご連絡いたします。</p>
      <p style="font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.9;color:#6a6357;margin:14px 0 0">メールが届かない場合は、<br>迷惑メールフォルダをご確認ください。</p>
    </section>



    <section style="padding:46px 24px;background:#f7f4ec;border-top:1px solid rgba(194,162,94,0.34)">
      <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;margin-bottom:12px">
        <span style="width:20px;height:2px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#a33f12,rgba(194,162,94,0));flex:none"></span>
        <span style="font-size:11.5px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:0.2em;color:#7a5e28">代表より</span>
      </div>
      <h2 style="font-size:22px;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 22px;font-weight:900;color:#241f19;letter-spacing:0.01em">成果の出ない営業代行を、<br>なくしたい。</h2>
      <figure style="margin:0 0 8px">
        <img src="assets/exec-taguchi.jpg" alt="ラフ・メイカー株式会社 代表・田口" style="width:100%;height:auto;display:block;background:#f1ece0">
        <figcaption style="font-size:12.5px;color:#6a6357;margin-top:8px">ラフ・メイカー株式会社 代表・田口</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:2.2;margin:18px 0 0;color:#4a443b">「営業代行にお金を払ったのに、成果はゼロだった」<br>これまで15年で18,000社の経営者とお会いするなかで、最も多く聞いた言葉です。</p>
      <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:2.2;margin:14px 0 0;color:#4a443b">問題は商品ではなく、決裁できる相手に届いていないこと。ただそれだけで、同じ商品でも結果は何倍も変わります。だからWは、18,000社の人脈から「ニーズを確認済みの決裁者」を選び抜いて紹介し、万が一届かなかった場合も粗利600万円までを保証する形にしました。</p>
      <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:2.2;margin:14px 0 0;color:#4a443b">ご相談のお時間は決して無駄にしませんので、ご連絡まで少々お待ちください。</p>
    </section>

    <section style="padding:46px 24px;background:#fffdf9;border-top:1px solid rgba(194,162,94,0.34)">
      <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;margin-bottom:12px">
        <span style="width:20px;height:2px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#a33f12,rgba(194,162,94,0));flex:none"></span>
        <span style="font-size:11.5px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:0.2em;color:#7a5e28">ご好評の声</span>
      </div>
      <h2 style="font-size:21px;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 22px;font-weight:900;color:#241f19;letter-spacing:0.01em">こんな課題を抱えていた企業様から<br>特にご好評いただいています</h2>
      <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px">
        <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;background:#fffdf9;border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:16px 18px;box-shadow:0 3px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.06)">
          <span style="flex:none;width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:50%;background:#7a5e28;color:#fffdf9;font-size:14px;font-weight:900;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-top:3px">✓</span>
          <span style="font-size:14.5px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.85;color:#241f19">アポ単価3万円を払っても、商談の質が低い</span>
        </div>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;background:#fffdf9;border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:16px 18px;box-shadow:0 3px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.06)">
          <span style="flex:none;width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:50%;background:#7a5e28;color:#fffdf9;font-size:14px;font-weight:900;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-top:3px">✓</span>
          <span style="font-size:14.5px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.85;color:#241f19">発注ニーズのある決裁者にたどり着けない</span>
        </div>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;background:#fffdf9;border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:16px 18px;box-shadow:0 3px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.06)">
          <span style="flex:none;width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:50%;background:#7a5e28;color:#fffdf9;font-size:14px;font-weight:900;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-top:3px">✓</span>
          <span style="font-size:14.5px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.85;color:#241f19">成果保証がなく、投資が丸ごと損失になる</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section id="schedule" style="padding:46px 0 52px;background:url(data:image/svg+xml;charset=utf-8,%3Csvg%20xmlns=%27http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%27%20width=%27560%27%20height=%27420%27%20viewBox=%270%200%20560%20420%27%3E%3Cg%20fill=%27none%27%20stroke-width=%271.5%27%3E%3Ccircle%20cx=%27205%27%20cy=%27210%27%20r=%27158%27%20stroke=%27%233b3228%27%20opacity=%270.10%27/%3E%3Ccircle%20cx=%27355%27%20cy=%27210%27%20r=%27158%27%20stroke=%27%23a3853f%27%20opacity=%270.13%27/%3E%3C/g%3E%3Cg%20fill=%27none%27%20stroke-width=%271%27%3E%3Ccircle%20cx=%27205%27%20cy=%27210%27%20r=%27108%27%20stroke=%27%233b3228%27%20opacity=%270.06%27/%3E%3Ccircle%20cx=%27355%27%20cy=%27210%27%20r=%27108%27%20stroke=%27%23a3853f%27%20opacity=%270.08%27/%3E%3C/g%3E%3Ccircle%20cx=%27280%27%20cy=%27210%27%20r=%275%27%20fill=%27%23a3853f%27%20opacity=%270.16%27/%3E%3C/svg%3E) right -180px top -40px/560px 420px no-repeat, radial-gradient(ellipse 430px 310px at 88% -8%,rgba(194,162,94,0.13),transparent 70%), #fffdf9;border-top:1px solid rgba(194,162,94,0.34)>
      <div style="padding:0 24px">
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;margin-bottom:12px">
          <span style="width:20px;height:2px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#a33f12,rgba(194,162,94,0));flex:none"></span>
          <span style="font-size:11.5px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:0.2em;color:#7a5e28">日程調整</span>
        </div>
        <h2 style="font-size:22px;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 12px;font-weight:900;color:#241f19;letter-spacing:0.01em">このまま<span style="background:linear-gradient(90deg,#a33f12,#c2571f);background-size:100% 2px;background-repeat:no-repeat;background-position:0 100%;padding-bottom:5px">日程を確保</span>できます。</h2>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:2.05;color:#4a443b;margin:0 0 20px">ご都合のよい枠をお選びいただければ、折り返しのご連絡を待たずに面談を確定できます。所要時間は30分ほどです。</p>
      </div>
      <div style="padding:0 16px">
        <div style="background:#fffdf9;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.10);box-shadow:0 12px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.16);overflow:hidden">
          <!-- Nitte embed begin -->
          <iframe src="https://nitte.app/zV75hcYfUghtb0UcaKkk4uoqmm83/a03e427e?embed=1#calendar" width="100%" height="100%" frameborder="0" class="nitte-embed" title="面談日程の予約カレンダー" loading="lazy"></iframe>
          <!-- Nitte embed end -->
        </div>
      </div>
      <p style="font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.9;color:#6a6357;margin:14px 24px 0">※ カレンダーが表示されない場合は、担当より1営業日以内にご連絡しますのでそのままお待ちください。</p>
    </section>
  </div>

  <footer style="padding:34px 24px 42px;background:#16120d;color:#b9b1a2">
    <img src="assets/logo-w-gold.png" alt="W" style="height:20px;width:auto;display:block">
    <p style="font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.8;margin:10px 0 22px">粗利600万円保証付きの営業支援サービス</p>
    <div style="display:flex;gap:16px;font-size:12.5px;margin-bottom:14px">
      <a href="https://laugh-maker.jp/company" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:#b9b1a2;white-space:nowrap">会社概要</a>
      <a href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1aoLPsLe9loWZZIPutqbFUnU6kxRVnT5W/view?usp=sharing" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:#b9b1a2;white-space:nowrap">プライバシーポリシー</a>
    </div>
    <div style="font-size:11.5px;color:#857e70">© ラフ・メイカー株式会社</div>
  </footer>
</div>
</x-dc>
</body>
</html>
